                      %mo ̲
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{H}(\underline{K})
              is an
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/allegory"} allegory
          .proof
            %h6#proof_2 Proof
            %p
              It is shown
              %a{:href => "http://rfcwalters.blogspot.com/2009/10/categorical-algebras-of-relations.html"} here
              that any bicategory of relations is an allegory.
          %h2#see_also See also
          %p Other attempted axiomatizations of the same idea “something that acts like the category of relations in a regular category” include:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/allegory"} allegory
            %li
              %p
